{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的纵向交替阅读路径更长，感受词密集时容易分散注意力，快速扫读不如X直接；X的左右分区更容易一眼抓住主线。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然不如X容易快速扫读，但加亮的关键词让每段心理变化更容易被抓住，而且把人物内心同时存在的渴望、顾虑、欢喜和不安保留得更完整。尤其从想靠近、害怕失去，到承认自己也需要对方，再到不再强求永远的保证，前后变化更有层次；音乐对应的感受也更细致，有具体的声音、身体和情绪变化。X更流畅简洁，但部分心理转折被合并或省略，细腻度和人物内心的完整性稍逊，因此总体选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "928f2206-161b-4e70-8f1e-c2a3269b1c9d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172726803486Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:28:38.709097+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ae82dc5cb72c6a06061245e2ed3bb820a6d33fd52a1c398b97b1df4c932f8155", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\